title: Rifles in the Allotment
subtitle: A red guard unit is caught with arms.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('rifles'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('rifles');
Q.lw_n = RG.lw.rnd(6, 19);
Q.red_guards_arms = Math.max(0, Q.red_guards_arms - 2);
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {guards: -0.3, repression: 3});
RG.news('Arms cache found in ' + Q.lw_town + ': ' + Q.lw_n + ' workers held', 2);
!}

= Rifles in the Allotment

A police patrol in **[+ lw_town +]** stopped a handcart on Sunday morning. Under the cabbages were forty rifles in oilcloth and two boxes of ammunition stamped with the eagle of the old army. By evening the police had dug up the allotment shed and arrested [+ lw_n +] men of the red guard. [? if lw_d_ours = 0 : Their commanders follow the [+ lw_d_fname +], and did not ask Berlin before they started collecting arms. ?]

- @disown: Disown them.
- @defend: Defend them in court.
- @free: Get them out of the police station tonight.

@disown
subtitle: The police lose interest. The red guards will not forgive it.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -8});
Q.red_guards_loyalty -= 10;
!}

The Zentrale says the party has nothing to do with private arsenals. The men get two years each.

@defend
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Why may workers not keep what the citizens' militias keep by the thousand? A jury might agree.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 4;
if (Math.random() < 0.4) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {loyalty: 8});
}
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : The jury acquits. In [+ lw_town +] the men are carried home on shoulders. ?][? if lw_out = 0 : The men are convicted, but the sentences are short. ?]

@free
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] A raid on the station. It will work only if the police are not waiting.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed action.
on-arrival: {!
RG.lw.against('uprising');
if (Math.random() < 0.55) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    Q.red_guards_loyalty += 12;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {militancy: 6, repression: 10});
    RG.news('Armed workers storm the police station in ' + Q.lw_town, 2);
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: 15, guards: -0.4});
    RG.news('Shooting at the police station in ' + Q.lw_town, 2);
}
if (Q.ultraleft_gone) { RG.lw.lean('offensive', 2, 5); } else { RG.lw.lean('ultraleft', 2, 5); }
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : Thirty men with pistols walk into the police station at midnight and walk out with their comrades. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The police were waiting. After ten minutes of shooting the guard falls back, carrying two wounded. The next day the security police arrive by train. ?]
